message: "If you use this software in your research or projects, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Context Drift Agent"
abstract: >
  An open-source AI agent for DataHub OSS that detects when dataset documentation
  becomes semantically inconsistent with the actual schema after a schema change.
  Uses LLM-based evaluation to explain why existing context is stale and writes
  a machine-readable freshness signal back into DataHub.
